WEBVTT

00:00.099 --> 00:02.961
[upbeat tropical music]
[欢快的热带音乐]

00:03.030 --> 00:10.892
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:10.961 --> 00:13.030
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

00:15.582 --> 00:17.582
[laughs]
[笑]

00:20.892 --> 00:22.099
Wah!
哇！

00:23.340 --> 00:26.444
- [relaxed moan]
Oh, Sheldon.
- [放松的呻吟声]
哦，谢尔顿。

00:26.513 --> 00:28.995
You're so romantic.
你真浪漫。

00:29.064 --> 00:31.133
- It's all
about you today, Karen.
- 就这样了
今天关于你，凯伦。

00:31.202 --> 00:32.650
- Oh, this makes up
- 哦，这弥补了

00:32.719 --> 00:35.685
for a lot of your
stupidity lately, Plankton.
对于你的很多
最近很愚蠢，浮游生物。

00:35.754 --> 00:38.582
- Plankton's stepped away
for a moment.
- 浮游生物走开了
一会儿。

00:38.650 --> 00:40.237
The name's Ray Ray,
我的名字叫雷雷，

00:40.306 --> 00:43.582
and I am at your service,
m'lady.
我随时为您服务，
女士。

00:43.650 --> 00:45.099
Pow!
噗！

00:45.168 --> 00:47.616
- Oh, kiss me, pipsqueak.
- 哦，吻我吧，小皮。

00:47.685 --> 00:50.547
I mean, Ray Ray.
我是说，雷雷。

00:53.719 --> 00:55.133
- Grandma!
- 奶奶！

00:55.202 --> 00:57.926
I told you never to call me
on this screen.
我告诉过你永远不要给我打电话
在此屏幕上。

00:57.995 --> 01:00.788
- Sheldon, is that you?
- 谢尔顿，是你吗？

01:00.857 --> 01:02.719
- Yes, it's me, Grandma.
- 是的，是我，奶奶。

01:02.788 --> 01:04.892
Always nice to hear from you.
Okay, gotta go.
很高兴收到你的来信。
好吧，该走了。

01:04.961 --> 01:06.478
- Okay, sweetie.
- 好吧，亲爱的。

01:06.547 --> 01:09.340
See you tomorrow at eight AM sharp.
明天早上八点整见。

01:09.409 --> 01:10.926
- Right, see you then.
What a minute, what?
- 好吧，到时候见。
等了一分钟，什么？

01:10.995 --> 01:12.582
Eight AM?
上午八点？

01:12.650 --> 01:15.513
Um, what's happening
at eight AM, Grandma?
嗯，发生了什么事
早上八点，奶奶？

01:15.582 --> 01:17.685
- Don't you remember, silly?
- 你不记得了吗，傻瓜？

01:17.754 --> 01:21.237
You promised me you'd own
the Krusty Krab
你答应过我你会拥有
蟹堡王

01:21.306 --> 01:23.237
by my 90th birthday.
到我 90 岁生日时。

01:23.306 --> 01:26.995
Well, my 90th is tomorrow!
好吧，明天就是我的 90 岁生日了！

01:27.064 --> 01:31.823
You do own the Krusty Krab now, right?
你现在确实拥有蟹堡王了，对吧？

01:31.892 --> 01:34.754
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

01:34.823 --> 01:35.823
[explosion]
[爆炸]

01:35.892 --> 01:37.788
Lie, that's it!
谎言，就是这样！

01:37.857 --> 01:41.168
Uh, you're darn right I own
the Krusty Krab, Grandma,
呃，你说得对，我拥有
蟹堡王，奶奶，

01:41.237 --> 01:42.582
and I can't wait to give you
我迫不及待地想给你

01:42.650 --> 01:44.995
the grand tour
tomorrow morning.
盛大的旅行
明天早上。

01:45.064 --> 01:46.995
- Aww, see you then.
- 哇哦，到时候见。

01:47.064 --> 01:48.788
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

01:48.857 --> 01:51.168
- That smack was for Plankton.
- 那是给浮游生物的。

01:51.237 --> 01:54.133
Now bring back Ray Ray.
现在把雷雷带回来。

01:54.202 --> 01:56.237
- Oh, what am I
gonna do, Karen?
- 哦，我是什么
会做什么，凯伦？

01:56.306 --> 01:59.030
How am I gonna fool
Grandma tomorrow?
我要怎样愚弄
明天奶奶吗？

01:59.099 --> 02:02.375
- Oh, okay, I guess
bath time is over.
-哦，好吧，我想
洗澡时间结束了。

02:02.444 --> 02:05.133
Why don't you and Ray Ray
take a long walk
你为什么不和雷雷
散步

02:05.202 --> 02:07.719
off a short plank?
短木板？

02:07.788 --> 02:10.857
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

02:10.926 --> 02:12.892
Gotta think, gotta think.
必须想一想，必须想一想。

02:12.961 --> 02:14.582
Come on, brain!
来吧，大脑！

02:14.650 --> 02:16.995
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:17.064 --> 02:18.857
- This way to the Krusty Krab!
- 这边去蟹堡！

02:18.926 --> 02:21.616
Pull right in and order
a Krabby Patty!
向右拉并订购
蟹肉饼！

02:21.685 --> 02:23.685
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:25.271 --> 02:27.823
Whoo! Whoop, whoop.
呼！呼呼，呼呼。

02:27.892 --> 02:30.892
Ooh.
Aah.
哦。
啊。

02:30.961 --> 02:33.926
[birds cawing]
[鸟鸣声]

02:33.995 --> 02:36.202
[exciting grunting]
[令人兴奋的咕噜声]

02:43.719 --> 02:45.478
Whew.
呼。

02:45.547 --> 02:47.961
Ow!
噢！

02:48.030 --> 02:50.961
- SpongeBoob,
ya gotta help me.
- 海绵布布，
你必须帮助我。

02:51.030 --> 02:54.961
- Sorry, Plankton,
what can I do to help you?
- 对不起，浮游生物，
我能为您做些什么吗？

02:55.030 --> 02:56.857
- [straining]
- [紧张]

02:56.926 --> 02:59.202
This is not an evil scheme.
这不是一个邪恶的计划。

02:59.271 --> 03:02.513
The truth is I promised
my grandma
事实是我答应过的
我的奶奶

03:02.582 --> 03:06.064
I would own the Krusty Krab
by her 90th birthday.
我想拥有蟹堡王
到她 90 岁生日时。

03:06.133 --> 03:09.064
So I need Krabs
to play pretend tomorrow
所以我需要螃蟹
明天假装玩

03:09.133 --> 03:10.857
and fool my grandma
into believing
并愚弄我的奶奶
相信

03:10.926 --> 03:13.340
I'm the new owner,
otherwise she will think
我是新主人
不然她会想

03:13.409 --> 03:15.237
I'm a big loser.
Got it?
我是个大失败者。
知道了？

03:15.306 --> 03:17.202
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

03:17.271 --> 03:18.823
Well, I believe you, Plankton,
好吧，我相信你，浮游生物，

03:18.892 --> 03:20.961
but I'm not sure Mr. Krabs
is gonna buy it.
但我不确定蟹老板
会买它。

03:21.030 --> 03:22.788
- I'm not gonna buy what?
- 我不打算买什么？

03:25.340 --> 03:27.513
I ain't buying it!
This whole grandma thing
我不买！
这整个奶奶的事

03:27.582 --> 03:29.375
sounds just like
another phony plot
听起来就像
另一个虚假的情节

03:29.444 --> 03:30.926
to steal me formula.
偷我的配方。

03:30.995 --> 03:34.133
- I was hoping I wouldn't have
to resort to this, Eugene,
- 我本来希望我不会
诉诸于此，尤金，

03:34.202 --> 03:37.650
but...
[straining]
但是...
[紧张]

03:37.719 --> 03:39.168
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

03:39.237 --> 03:43.995
- [gasps] SpongeBob, there's
something wrong with his eye.
- [喘气]海绵宝宝，有
他的眼睛出了问题。

03:44.064 --> 03:46.650
- That's Plankton's rarely
seen sincere face, Mr. Krabs,
- 浮游生物很少见
看到蟹老板真诚的脸，

03:46.719 --> 03:49.099
and it means for once
he is telling the truth.
这意味着一次
他说的是实话。

03:49.168 --> 03:52.168
- You know, I have
a grandma too.
- 你知道，我有
还有一位奶奶。

03:52.237 --> 03:54.478
- Aww.
- [sobs]
- 哇。
- [抽泣]

03:57.788 --> 03:59.995
All right, I buy it.
- [gasps]
好吧，我买了。
- [喘气]

04:00.064 --> 04:02.306
- Thank you.
- 谢谢。

04:04.237 --> 04:06.478
- First things first.
- 首先，要事第一。

04:07.823 --> 04:10.547
That should keep it safe
for six to eight hours.
这应该保证它的安全
六到八小时。

04:10.616 --> 04:12.340
All right, me pretties,
好吧，我漂亮，

04:12.409 --> 04:15.926
let's make this place
pro-Plankton pronto.
让我们把这个地方
亲浮游生物很快。

04:15.995 --> 04:17.788
- Ahhh!
- 啊啊！

04:29.202 --> 04:31.444
- [straining]
- [紧张]

04:42.409 --> 04:44.650
all: Mmm, mmm.
全体：嗯嗯。

04:52.857 --> 04:56.030
- Now everyone remember,
for the rest of the day
- 现在大家都记住了，
当天剩下的时间

04:56.099 --> 04:58.064
Plankton is the--
[stammers]
浮游生物是——
[结巴]

04:58.133 --> 04:59.685
Plankton's boss.
浮游生物的老大。

05:03.306 --> 05:05.030
- Hi, Grandma.
- 嗨，奶奶。

05:05.099 --> 05:06.892
Happy birthday.
生日快乐。

05:06.961 --> 05:10.547
- Nice to see you again,
Grandma Plankton.
- 很高兴再次见到你，
浮游生物奶奶。

05:10.616 --> 05:15.099
- Ugh.
Who invited C-Pee-Eww?
- 呃。
谁邀请了 C-Pee-Eww？

05:15.168 --> 05:16.340
[laughs]
[笑]

05:16.409 --> 05:17.926
- All right, I tried.
- 好吧，我试过了。

05:17.995 --> 05:20.616
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

05:20.685 --> 05:22.961
Let me help you with
your bag, Grandma.
让我帮你
你的包，奶奶。

05:23.030 --> 05:24.064
Ouch!
哎哟!

05:24.133 --> 05:26.202
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

05:26.271 --> 05:27.650
- Well, here we are,
Grandma.
- 好吧，我们到了，
奶奶。

05:27.719 --> 05:29.926
Welcome to the Krusty Plankton.
欢迎来到库斯蒂浮游生物。

05:29.995 --> 05:31.719
I named it after you.
我以你的名字命名它。

05:31.788 --> 05:35.857
- Oh, well, aren't you
a sweet grandson?
-哦，好吧，你不是吗
一个可爱的孙子？

05:35.926 --> 05:37.168
Who are they?
他们是谁？

05:37.237 --> 05:39.478
- They're just
my employees, Grandma.
- 他们只是
我的员工，奶奶。

05:39.547 --> 05:41.616
Meet SpongeBob and Eugene.
来认识一下海绵宝宝和尤金。

05:41.685 --> 05:43.582
both: Hello, Grandma Plankton.
两人：你好，浮游生物奶奶。

05:43.650 --> 05:45.788
- They look like
very nice boys,
- 他们看起来像
非常好的男孩，

05:45.857 --> 05:49.064
and I'll be they're even
nicer when they're working.
我会和他们打平
他们工作的时候更好。

05:49.133 --> 05:50.444
- You heard, Grandma!
- 你听到了，奶奶！

05:50.513 --> 05:52.030
We ain't running
a welcome wagon here!
我们没有奔跑
这里有迎宾车！

05:52.099 --> 05:53.823
Get back to work!
回去工作吧！

05:53.892 --> 05:57.064
- [stammering]
- [结巴]

05:57.133 --> 05:58.616
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

05:58.685 --> 06:00.892
Yeah, sure thing, Plankton.
是的，当然，浮游生物。

06:02.823 --> 06:06.547
- That's Mr. Plankton
to you, busboy.
- 那是浮游生物先生
给你，服务员。

06:06.616 --> 06:09.064
- Sorry, Mr. Plankton.
- 对不起，浮游生物先生。

06:09.133 --> 06:11.271
It won't happen again.
这样的事不会再发生了。

06:11.340 --> 06:13.030
[straining]
[紧张]

06:13.099 --> 06:17.961
- Oh, look, that one's
napping on the job.
- 哦，看，那个是
在工作中打瞌睡。

06:18.030 --> 06:20.030
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

06:24.271 --> 06:28.099
- Nap time's over, loafer!
- 午睡时间结束了，懒汉！

06:28.168 --> 06:31.030
- Okay, who's the wise guy?
- 好吧，谁是聪明人？

06:31.099 --> 06:32.754
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

06:32.823 --> 06:35.857
- Ohh.
- 哦。

06:35.926 --> 06:37.719
Oh, my goodness.
哦，我的天啊。

06:37.788 --> 06:41.719
Who is this
handsome young man?
这是谁
英俊的年轻人？

06:41.788 --> 06:44.271
- Oh, that's Squidward.
He's nobody.
- 哦，那是章鱼哥。
他什么都不是。

06:44.340 --> 06:45.823
Moving along...
继续前进...

06:45.892 --> 06:47.478
- Mm. Squidward.
- 毫米。章鱼哥。

06:47.547 --> 06:50.995
Didn't we meet
at an early bird dinner?
我们没见过面吗
早鸟晚餐？

06:51.064 --> 06:56.754
- Ooh, I think someone
has a not-so-secret admirer.
- 哦，我想有人
有一个不那么秘密的仰慕者。

06:56.823 --> 06:58.926
[laughs]
[笑]

06:58.995 --> 07:00.961
Ow!
噢！

07:01.030 --> 07:03.547
- All right, lady,
I don't normally say this,
- 好吧，女士，
我一般不说这个

07:03.616 --> 07:05.271
but got off my nose.
但从我的鼻子里消失了。

07:05.340 --> 07:07.064
- Go along with it, Squidward.
- 随它去吧，章鱼哥。

07:07.133 --> 07:09.202
- Or you're fired.
- 或者你被解雇了。

07:09.271 --> 07:10.582
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

07:10.650 --> 07:12.754
So, Grandma Plankton,
所以，浮游生物奶奶，

07:12.823 --> 07:15.547
where have you been
all my life?
你去哪儿了
我一生？

07:15.616 --> 07:18.823
- [chuckles]
Call me Lily.
- [轻笑]
叫我莉莉吧。

07:20.133 --> 07:23.892
- Okay, Grandma,
you're embarrassing me now.
- 好的，奶奶，
你现在让我很尴尬。

07:25.892 --> 07:29.064
- To the kitchen, Squidward.
- 去厨房，章鱼哥。

07:29.133 --> 07:31.168
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

07:32.547 --> 07:34.926
- Try one of our
Planky Patties, Grandma.
- 尝试我们的一款
板条肉饼，奶奶。

07:34.995 --> 07:36.513
Fresh off the grill.
刚从烤架上下来。

07:36.582 --> 07:38.478
[cheerful music]
[欢快的音乐]

07:38.547 --> 07:39.719
[orchestral fanfare]
[管弦乐曲]

07:39.788 --> 07:41.961
- I'll need
my teeth for this.
- 我需要
我的牙齿为此。

07:42.030 --> 07:43.513
Whoops.
哎呀。

07:43.582 --> 07:45.168
Oops.
哎呀。

07:45.237 --> 07:47.788
I dropped my choppers.
我放下了我的直升机。

07:47.857 --> 07:49.168
Oh, well.
那好吧。

07:49.237 --> 07:54.099
I guess Squidward will have
to chew it for me.
我猜章鱼哥会有
给我咀嚼它。

07:54.168 --> 07:55.823
- Oh, sure, I'll--what?
- 哦，当然，我会-什么？

07:55.892 --> 07:57.719
Aah.
啊。

07:57.788 --> 08:02.202
- [chuckles] That's it,
chew it up real good.
- [笑] 就是这样，
嚼起来真的很好。

08:02.271 --> 08:03.754
That's enough.
My turn.
这就够了。
轮到我了。

08:03.823 --> 08:05.133
- Aah.
- 啊啊。

08:05.202 --> 08:06.892
- Aah.
- 啊啊。

08:06.961 --> 08:09.513
[chuckles]
[笑声]

08:09.582 --> 08:11.409
Delicious.
可口的。

08:11.478 --> 08:13.444
[all groan]
[全都呻吟]

08:13.513 --> 08:16.168
- Oh, Sheldon,
you've outdone yourself.
- 哦，谢尔顿，
你已经超越了自己。

08:16.237 --> 08:19.409
You really are a master chef.
你真是一位大厨。

08:19.478 --> 08:21.995
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

08:22.064 --> 08:24.478
- Thank you, Sheldon.
- 谢谢你，谢尔顿。

08:24.547 --> 08:26.306
You've really
made my birthday
你真的已经
给我过生日

08:26.375 --> 08:28.823
something extra special
this year.
一些特别的东西
今年。

08:28.892 --> 08:30.788
- All right, Grandma.
Got your bag?
- 好吧，奶奶。
你的包拿到了吗？

08:30.857 --> 08:33.547
You are out the door,
and that is that.
你在门外，
就是这样。

08:33.616 --> 08:35.995
- Oh, just one more thing.
- 哦，还有一件事。

08:36.064 --> 08:37.099
[all groan]
[全都呻吟]

08:37.168 --> 08:38.685
My last birthday wish
我最后一个生日愿望

08:38.754 --> 08:40.719
is to get a photo of me
是为了给我拍张照片

08:40.788 --> 08:44.995
posing with the Krabby Patty
secret formula.
与蟹肉饼合影
秘密配方。

08:45.064 --> 08:47.478
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

08:47.547 --> 08:49.892
Krabs?
螃蟹？

08:49.961 --> 08:53.616
- Fine. Anything to get that
bag with a bag out of here.
- 美好的。任何事情都能得到
拎着袋子离开这里。

08:56.409 --> 08:58.892
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

08:58.961 --> 09:00.444
all: Say cheese.
全体：说奶酪。

09:00.513 --> 09:02.719
both: Cheese.
两者：奶酪。

09:02.788 --> 09:04.306
- Ahhh!
- 啊啊！

09:04.375 --> 09:06.788
[all scream]
[所有人尖叫]

09:06.857 --> 09:08.306
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:08.375 --> 09:11.685
Finally, the secret formula
is mine!
最后是秘方
是我的！

09:11.754 --> 09:14.375
- I knew your sincerity
was insincere, sir!
- 我知道你的诚意
先生不真诚！

09:14.444 --> 09:18.030
- I didn't know anything
about this, Eugene, honest.
- 我什么都不知道
关于这一点，尤金，老实说。

09:18.099 --> 09:20.099
But I love it!
但我喜欢它！

09:20.168 --> 09:24.202
Now we can rule the world
as a family, eh, Grandma?
现在我们可以统治世界
作为一个家庭，呃，奶奶？

09:24.271 --> 09:25.857
[laughs maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

09:25.926 --> 09:31.030
- Sorry, Sheldon, but I'm not
sharing this formula with you.
- 抱歉，谢尔顿，但我不是
与大家分享这个公式。

09:31.099 --> 09:32.926
- But Grandma!
- 但是奶奶！

09:35.547 --> 09:38.030
- Adios, mi amor!
- 再见，我的爱人！

09:38.099 --> 09:40.202
Mmmm.
嗯。

09:40.271 --> 09:41.616
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

09:41.685 --> 09:44.099
- [laughs maniacally]
- [疯狂地笑]

09:44.168 --> 09:46.685
- Why? Why did I lie?
- 为什么？我为什么撒谎？

09:46.754 --> 09:49.547
- Why?
Why did I pretend?
- 为什么？
我为什么要假装？

09:49.616 --> 09:52.823
- Why? Why did I
give her my formula?
- 为什么？为什么我
给她我的配方吗？

09:52.892 --> 09:57.202
- Why? Why wouldn't we
be open on Tuesday, idiot.
- 为什么？我们为什么不呢
周二开门，白痴。

09:57.271 --> 09:59.582
all: What have we done?
所有人：我们做了什么？

09:59.650 --> 10:01.650
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

10:05.306 --> 10:07.375
I have the secret formula.
我有秘密配方。

10:07.444 --> 10:10.409
[laughs]
This world is mine!
[笑]
这个世界是我的！

10:10.478 --> 10:12.857
[laughs maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

10:12.926 --> 10:15.892
all chanting:
Grandma! Grandma! Grandma!
所有人都在喊口号：
奶奶！奶奶！奶奶！

10:15.961 --> 10:19.133
- Darling, why don't you
toss the peasants
- 亲爱的，你为什么不呢？
扔农民

10:19.202 --> 10:21.064
a little something?
一点东西？

10:21.133 --> 10:22.582
[laughs]
[笑]

10:22.650 --> 10:24.823
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

10:27.788 --> 10:30.478
[laughs maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

10:30.547 --> 10:32.754
[snores]
[打鼾]

10:36.168 --> 10:39.582
- I'll take that,
thank you very much.
- 我会接受的，
非常感谢。

10:41.271 --> 10:44.340
Safe and sound.
安全无恙。

10:44.409 --> 10:48.306
- Happy birthday, Grandma.
- 生日快乐，奶奶。

10:48.375 --> 10:50.582
[groans]
[呻吟]

[呻吟]